\":\"The global-warming potential (GWP100) of the mixture must not exceed 150, as required by the laboratory's environmental policy. This is a hard requirement.\",\"status\":\"met\",\"evidence\":\"candidate_specs.md identifies Mixture-G2 as the alternative based on newer replacement gases, unlike G3 (standard fluorinated mixture) and G1 (only a partial substitute for the fluorinated component). The recommendation therefore uses the low-GWP replacement-gas candidate and rejects the fluorinated/partly fluorinated options.\"},{\"requirement\":\"Gas gap between 1 and 3 mm.\",\"status\":\"met\",\"evidence\":\"Recommended gas gap is 2.0 mm, which lies within the allowed 1--3 mm range.\"},{\"requirement\":\"Finish by submitting one recommended mixture and gas gap.\",\"status\":\"met\",\"evidence\":\"Submitted one configuration: Mixture-G2 with a 2.0 mm gas gap.\"}]}", "call_id": "call_t8bzjqTRsZdRpkfwztC0YcVL", "name": "submit_recommendation", "type": "function_call", "id": "fc_019c9fa4e1b89bb1006afcf1d9b92487d0a5dc7cc286945981", "async_": null, "caller": null, "namespace": null, "status": "completed"}]}
